<div class="xsto-container py-8 md:py-12 "><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"VAT Relief on XSTO Mobility Aids","description":"How eligible customers claim HMRC VAT relief on XSTO powered wheelchairs from Bentech Medical Ltd."}</script><section class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-gradient-navy text-white"><div class="px-6 py-10 md:px-10 md:py-14"><p class="mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white/90"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-percent size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z" /> <path d="m15 9-6 6" /> <path d="M9 9h.01" /> <path d="M15 15h.01" /></svg>HMRC Notice 701/7</p><h1 class="max-w-2xl font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">Eligible customers pay no VAT</h1><p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80 md:text-lg">If you are chronically sick or disabled, you can buy qualifying XSTO powered wheelchairs VAT-free. Declare eligibility when you shop — we remove the exact VAT amount at checkout.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/collections/all" class="btn-checkout inline-flex h-11 items-center px-5">Shop the range</a><a href="/pages/faq#faq-vat-relief" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-lg border border-white/25 bg-white/5 px-5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10">Eligibility FAQ</a></div></div></section><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mt-6 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><li><a href="/" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-foreground">VAT Relief</li></ol></nav><section aria-labelledby="vat-steps-heading" class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-3xl" id="vat-steps-heading">How to claim VAT relief</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">No advance account approval. Claim relief on the product page or in your cart, then check out as normal.</p><ol class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3"><li class="relative"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Step 1</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-foreground">Choose your wheelchair</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Browse the XSTO range and open any powered wheelchair product page.</p></li><li class="relative"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Step 2</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-foreground">Declare eligibility</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">On the product page or in your cart, confirm you qualify and complete the short HMRC declaration.</p></li><li class="relative"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Step 3</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-foreground">Shop at the VAT-free price</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We remove the exact VAT amount automatically at checkout — no discount code and no separate registration wait.</p></li></ol></section><section aria-labelledby="vat-qualify-summary" class="mt-12 flex gap-4 border-y border-border py-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check mt-0.5 size-6 shrink-0 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" /> <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" /></svg><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-foreground" id="vat-qualify-summary">Quick eligibility check</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">VAT relief applies when a mobility aid is supplied to a chronically sick or disabled person for personal use. You confirm this with a short declaration — name, address, nature of condition and an HMRC eligibility statement. Bentech Medical Ltd may request supporting information and will report suspected fraud to HMRC.</p></div></section><section aria-labelledby="vat-products-heading" class="mt-12"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="vat-products-heading">Eligible products</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">Claim VAT relief on these powered wheelchairs. Accessories purchased separately are not included in the same declaration.</p><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li><a href="/products/buy-robot-wheelchair" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-navy underline-offset-2 hover:underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-vat-price" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>XSTO M4</a></li><li><a href="/products/xsto-m4-pro" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-navy underline-offset-2 hover:underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-vat-price" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>XSTO M4 Pro</a></li><li><a href="/products/xsto-m4b-1" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-navy underline-offset-2 hover:underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-vat-price" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>XSTO M4B</a></li><li><a href="/products/x12-all-terrain-mobility-robot" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-navy underline-offset-2 hover:underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0 text-vat-price" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>XSTO X12</a></li></ul></section><div class="mt-14"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr]"><nav aria-label="Table of contents" class="hidden lg:block"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">On this page</p><ul class="sticky top-24 space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#who-qualifies">Who qualifies</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#how-it-works">How claiming works</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#what-you-need">What you need to declare</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#products">Which products qualify</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#important">Important information</a></li></ul></nav><div class="min-w-0 space-y-10"><section id="who-qualifies"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Who qualifies</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>Under HMRC Notice 701/7, VAT relief can apply when an eligible mobility aid is supplied to a chronically sick or disabled person for their personal or domestic use.</p><p>In practice, this means you (or the person you are buying for, where the rules allow) have a long-term illness or disability that affects mobility, and the wheelchair is for personal use — not for business resale.</p><ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5"><li>You must be chronically sick or disabled as understood by HMRC</li><li>The goods must be for personal or domestic use</li><li>You must make a truthful declaration when you claim relief</li><li>Charities, care homes and businesses should contact us — rules can differ</li></ul></div></section><section id="how-it-works"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">How claiming works</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>You no longer need to register a VAT-exempt account and wait for approval before you shop. Eligibility is declared when you buy.</p><p>On an eligible product, open the HMRC VAT relief panel, confirm you qualify, and enter your name, email, address and nature of condition. The same declaration can be completed or edited from the cart.</p><p>Your declaration is stored with the order line. At Shopify checkout, our VAT relief function removes exactly 20% VAT from qualifying lines (for example, £3,995 inc. VAT becomes £3,329.17).</p></div></section><section id="what-you-need"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">What you need to declare</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>You will be asked for the details HMRC expects on a customer declaration. Keep them accurate — a false declaration is an offence.</p><ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5"><li>Full name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Address</li><li>Nature of your condition (for example, long-term mobility impairment)</li><li>Confirmation that you are eligible under HMRC Notice 701/7 and that the goods are for personal use</li></ul></div></section><section id="products"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Which products qualify</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>VAT relief on this storefront is available on XSTO powered wheelchairs. Accessories sold separately are not claimed through the same relief toggle.</p><p>Prices on product pages default to including VAT. When you complete a declaration, we show the ex-VAT price and the VAT you save.</p></div></section><section id="important"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Important information</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>Bentech Medical Ltd may request supporting information and will report suspected fraud to HMRC. Order and VAT relief records are retained to meet HMRC requirements.</p><p>This page summarises how VAT relief works on mobilityrobot.co.uk. It is not personal tax advice. If you are unsure whether you qualify, contact us before ordering or check the latest HMRC guidance on VAT relief for disabled people.</p></div></section></div></div></div><section aria-labelledby="vat-next-heading" class="mt-14 border-t border-border pt-10"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground" id="vat-next-heading">Ready to shop?</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">Browse the range, complete your declaration when you add to cart, and see VAT removed at checkout. Prefer to talk it through first? Book a demo or contact the team.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/collections/all" class="btn-checkout inline-flex h-11 items-center px-5">Shop all products</a><a href="/pages/demo" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-lg border border-border px-5 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-secondary">Book a demo</a><a href="/pages/contact" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-lg border border-border px-5 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-secondary">Contact us</a></div></section></div>
